{%- comment -%}
  ============================================================
  PRIMAL WIN — SECTION ALIGNMENT STANDARD (paste in every section)
  ============================================================

  Client rule: logo se footer tak sab ek line par align ho.
  Section frame = 1440px (--pw-max). Content column = 1280px (--pw-content).
  pw-container uses --pw-inner (content + gutters). Logo line = --pw-gutter.
  Har section mein yahi 3 cheezein use karo.

  1) HTML wrapper:
     <div class="pw-container"> ... content ... </div>

  2) Section reset (top of {% style %}):
     #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} {
       margin: 0 !important;
       padding: 0 !important;
       max-width: none !important;
     }

  3) Container CSS (section id ke andar):
     {% render 'pw-align-vars' %}

     #YourSection-{{ section.id }} .pw-container {
       width: 100%;
       max-width: var(--pw-inner);
       margin-inline: auto;
       padding-inline: var(--pw-gutter);
       box-sizing: border-box;
     }

  AVOID (zoom par design bigadta hai):
  - alag max-width (1200, 1280, 100% random)
  - alag padding (40px, 50px, 60px mixed)
  - 100vw / negative margin bleed without plan
  - absolute images jo container se bahar nikal jayein

  Send next section code → align kar dunga.
{%- endcomment -%}
